[36m(TaskRunner pid=3430201)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3430201)[0m \sqrt{324^2 + 504^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 254016} = \sqrt{359000} = 600.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3430201)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3430201)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3430201)[0m Therefore, the largest possible real part of the expression is \(\boxed{600}\).
